@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData Manifest-Driven Documentation Generation Flow

actor Maintainer
folder "docs/manifests" as Manifests
rectangle "config/documentation.json\n(global settings and defaults)" as Config
folder "docs/shared\n(front matter)" as Shared
folder "Ordered Markdown sections" as Sources
rectangle "Invoke-Documentation.ps1" as Engine
rectangle "Manifest discovery\nand normalisation" as Discovery
rectangle "Validation" as Validation
rectangle "Markdown assembly" as Assembly
rectangle "document-toc.lua" as TocFilter
rectangle "landscape.lua" as LayoutFilter
rectangle "Pandoc" as Pandoc
folder "docs/build" as Output

Maintainer --> Manifests : adds or changes a guide
Maintainer --> Sources : authors content
Config --> Discovery : directories, tools, defaults
Manifests --> Discovery : every *.json
Discovery --> Validation : normalised documents
Shared --> Validation
Sources --> Validation
Validation --> Assembly : valid inputs
Shared --> Assembly : cover, copyright, revision
Sources --> Assembly : ordered sections
Assembly --> TocFilter : front matter + TOC marker + chapters
TocFilter --> LayoutFilter : format-aware TOC inserted
LayoutFilter --> Pandoc : transformed document
Pandoc --> Output : HTML / DOCX / PDF
Assembly --> Output : merged Markdown and inventory

note right of Assembly
Order:
1. Cover
2. Copyright
3. Revision history
4. TOC marker
5. Chapters
end note
@enduml
